'' RUN: 'cast( string, x ) = "ab"' typed (an untyped comparison was TKO0994), and 'cast( ustring,
'' x )' over a UDT with a ustring cast and over a uslice (was TKO0756) -- print, compare, '&',
'' '&=', dim, select case, byval / byref / string arguments; measured against fbc-modern 1.20.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -w all tests/codegen/src/cast-string-udt.tiko -o tests/codegen/caststringudt.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: warning
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/caststringudt.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/caststringudt.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
